  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "The subculture's fashion is inspired by a number of prior subcultures, fashion trends and forms of entertainment, including mall goth, 1990s–2000s fashion, skater culture, anime, Japanese street fashion, cosplay, K-pop, BDSM, emo, scene, hip hop, and rave. Dazed described the aesthetic as \"A little bit bondage, a little bit baby\". Outfits commonly consist of baggy, thrifted clothes."
